As far as I know, the Demon Prince bug is fixed in 2.3.

You cannot teleport out of the dungeon any more with the Amulet, but a bug in
2.3 permits levitating up stairs while overloaded.  If you don't use this
bug, the original poster did approximately as well as it is conceivable to do
in a game of Nethack without cheating.
